# OS / editor cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*~

# Node (no deps committed; here in case tooling is added later)
node_modules/

# Editor / tooling config (not part of the app)
.claude/

# Local working docs (not for the public repo)
HANDOFF.md

# Reference screenshots of other apps (design reference only, not for the public repo)
mancala/reference/

# RTDB snapshots (backups/rtdb-backup.mjs). Real family data - every player's name, player code
# and full stats - so the snapshots stay LOCAL. The script itself is tracked; its output never is.
backups/*.json

# Visual-suite output (test-visual.mjs). Regenerated on every run; look at it, do not commit it.
.visual-out/

# reference/ is DELIBERATELY tracked, images and .MOV recordings included - a session that cannot
# see the picture builds the wrong thing (reference/README.md). mancala/reference/ above is the
# frozen exception from an earlier, opposite decision; never extend that rule to reference/.
# The leading slash is load-bearing: an unanchored `reference/` matches a directory of that name at
# ANY depth, which would silently un-ignore mancala/reference/ too.
!/reference/
